      "block_id": "s1:block:02146-02147",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "なんだとぉ！",
      "en": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02149-02151",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "騎士の言葉に、相対していた女性から殺気が膨れ上がり、\n女性は背負っていた剣の柄に手を掛け、\nそれを見た騎士達も口元に笑みを浮かべて腰の剣に手を掛ける",
      "en": "At his words, the woman's bloodlust surged. She put her hand on the hilt of her back-sword. Seeing her, the knights grinned and moved to draw."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02153-02154",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "何をしている",
      "en": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02160-02161",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Soldier",
      "jp": "うっ……セリカ……シルフィル……",
      "en": "Ugh... Celica... Sylphil..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02163-02176",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "やはり……\n割って入った俺に、後ずさる騎士達を見て俺は確信した。\n着ている鎧こそはレヴィアの部下と同じ物だが、\n此奴らはレヴィアの直属の部下ではない。\nレヴィア直属の騎士達は、隊を率いるレヴィアの性格もあって、\n皆礼儀を重んじ、相手が敵以外であれば暴言を吐く事は無く、\nさらに先の大戦で形的にレヴィアを救った俺の事を、\n呼び捨てにする事もない。\n傲慢な言葉遣いや、俺を見て後ずさる此奴らは、\n恐らく今回の任務の為に他の部隊から臨時で編入された\n者達なのだろう。",
      "en": "As I thought... Seeing the knights back away when I stepped in, I was certain. Their armor is the same as Levia's subordinates, but these are not her direct subordinates. Levia's own knights, in part because of Levia's character as their commander, all value courtesy, and would never hurl insults at anyone who isn't an enemy. Moreover, they would never address me without an honorific, since I formally saved Levia in the last war. With their arrogant speech and the way they back away at the sight of me, these men were likely temporarily assigned from other units for this mission."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02178-02179",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Soldier",
      "jp": "貴様、その女を庇うのか！",
      "en": "You! Are you protecting that woman?!"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02181-02183",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "庇う？\n俺はただ何をしているのかと聞いているだけだが",
      "en": "Protect her?\nI just asked what you were doing."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02185-02186",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Soldier",
      "jp": "くっ……",
      "en": "Tch..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02188-02193",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "言えないという事は自分達に非があると判っているのだろう。\n見ると騎士達の手にはこの地方の特産であるという果物が\n握られており、すぐ側の果物を扱っている露店の店主が\n不安そうに此方を窺っている事から見て、\n大方この騎士達が果物を取って代金を支払わなかったのだろう。",
      "en": "If they can't answer, they know they're at fault. I saw the knights were holding fruit, a local specialty, and the fruit stall owner was watching us anxiously. Most likely, they took the fruit without paying."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02199-02200",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "誰だい、あんた？",
      "en": "Who're you?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02202-02202",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "赤毛の女性が、訝しげな視線で俺を見ている。",
      "en": "The red-haired woman gave me a dubious look."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02204-02205",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "ただの通りすがりだ",
      "en": "Just a passerby."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02207-02208",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "俺と赤毛の女性の視線が逸れた瞬間に、騎士達は\n兜で顔を隠す様にして足早にその場を立ち去ろうとする。",
      "en": "When my gaze and the redhead's finally broke, the knights hid their faces and hurried off."
    }
  ]
}

